# What must never end up in a published image -- above all config/local.json, which holds a
# deployment's RPC password.
#
# games/ is NOT excluded: the DOS Diversions' shareware files ship, as they do in this
# repository, and each package travels whole with its own licence text. See umbrel/Dockerfile.
#
# THE ADMINISTRATIVE SUITE IS EXCLUDED, and this is the layer that does it for container
# images. package.json's `files` list keeps it out of the npm tarball, but Docker has never
# heard of `files` -- `COPY server ./server` takes the directory whole -- so without these
# three lines the Umbrel image would carry a wallet that can spend money, in a build nobody
# is supposed to be running yet (operator, 2026-09-18: "Nobody should ever use the wallet
# build for now, and we should exclude it from shipping entirely").
#
# These paths are the same list as ADMIN_PATHS in scripts/build-edition.js, and
# test/release-guard.test.js fails if the two ever disagree.
server/admin
server/rpc/admin-allowlist.js
public/js/admin
public/css/admin.css
.git
.github
node_modules
data
worklog
test
umbrel/blockyard
config/local.json
config/local.json.bak-*
config/blockyard.json
docs/STATE-*.md
docs/PRIVATE-*.md
docs/images
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
.claude
